(C68, F4 T6f: the kappa_shear (von Mises hardening on -kapsh) is an integration-point state. Four tria3
 (1-point rule, nodal recovery = arithmetic mean, Professional) on a
 non-uniform field; HEAD read the h-lumped nodal value back.
 Targets = Professional 02-08-2026, scratch probe c68_kapsh3_tri.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
